<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Natsumi Kogori is suspicious, you say.<PG>
Indeed, though it was her viewpoint at first, in the latter half there is<BR>
no subjective viewpoint of hers, is there.<PG>
If she is the culprit, then from the latter half on there must surely have been <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="・・・">something</STYLE> that greatly overturned her values.<PG>
The theory that Natsumi Kogori is the culprit, I do not dislike it.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
